2DA V1.0
*
# ethren: hide in shadows by the light where the thief stands (docs/rules/classes.md, "Skill effects and
# DCs"). LIGHT is the highest light level of the band (Map::GetLightLevel, 0-100: the area's lightmap
# darkened by the time of day's tint), DC the hide's DC there, LABEL what the log says (_ for spaces).
# The book's bands: 5 night, dim or shaded; 10 moderate cover or a full moon; 15 daylight in deep shadow;
# 20 broad daylight with little cover. Rows from dark to bright; anything brighter takes the last row.
         LIGHT  DC  LABEL
DIM      30     5   dim
MODERATE 50     10  moderate_light
SHADOW   75     15  light,_in_shadow
DAYLIGHT 100    20  broad_daylight
